  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception-action cycle: sensing obstacles and executing motion pulses. The specification enforces safe, coverage-biased exploration: random_walk in clear, short forward pulses, conservative turn recovery on obstacles, and rapid return to exploration after recovery. Only one controllable is enabled per state, and all uncontrollables are total. Full_rotate is used only as a last-resort in deadlock recovery.",
